      "role": "user",
      "content": "The format is standard CSV, as per the legacy engine requirements. \n\nActually, before you get too far into that, I need your technical assessment on the transition itself. Our engineers are concerned that moving from a predictive model to a rule-based one might create gaps. What's your take on replacing your current predictive capabilities with a hard-coded diagnostic system?",
